hub.com/user-attachments/assets/fbcfa63f-b999-4630-b3c5-be9307f7b03a\" />\n4.The viewport STILL here\n<img width=\"1543\" height=\"903\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ed006afa-ce75-4f31-8eaf-592e7d1b58aa\" />\n\n\n*As shown in the last screenshot, the internal viewport still exists*\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nhere: [止战之战.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25393249/default.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116433/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116433/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}